  "comment": "Date/Time Hitung penjualan tahunan dikelompokkan per tahun, per bulan, dan per minggu (#mysql) Kasus --&gt; Query SELECT YEAR( tglTransaksiJual ) AS tahun, MONTH( tglTransaksiJual ) AS bulan, WEEK( tglTransaksiJual, 5 ) - WEEK( DATE_SUB( tglTransaksiJual, INTERVAL DAYOFMONTH( tglTransaksiJual ) - 1 DAY ) , 5 ) +1 AS minggu, SUM( uangDibayar ) AS total_sales FROM transaksijual GROUP BY tahun, bulan,",
